/**
 * Mauville Gym electric puzzle — exact OG replication.
 *
 * Data extracted from pokeemerald:
 *   - include/constants/metatile_labels.h (metatile IDs)
 *   - src/field_specials.c MauvilleGymSetDefaultBarriers (toggle logic)
 *   - data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc (switch scripts + barrier setup)
 *
 * The OG logic: stepping on any switch calls `MauvilleGymSetDefaultBarriers`
 * which walks the map in the puzzle area (y 5-16, x 0-8) and flips EVERY
 * barrier metatile between its ON and OFF variants according to the table
 * defined in the C source. We replicate this at runtime by mapping each
 * tile ID to its "partner" tile ID and swapping on every press.
 */

